# Agent workflow

**Sources:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md); [nextjs-node-server-2026.mdc](nextjs-node-server-2026.mdc); [tdd.mdc](tdd.mdc) (tests + `*.test.*`). Cite paths — do not paste bodies. Tests policy & Playwright: **tdd.mdc**; **`@tdd`** for strict test-first.

**Workflow:** Inspect before edits; match repo patterns; small diffs; preserve UI unless asked; end with files / tests / assumptions.

**Anti-stale:** Check [`package.json`](../../package.json). App Router on Node, **`standalone`** — not Pages Router defaults (`getServerSideProps`, `next/head` for new code). **`params` / `searchParams`:** async per AGENTS locale pattern.

**Next.js:** Depth in **nextjs-node-server-2026.mdc**. Summary: RSC + server data unless client needs interactivity; no app-wide **`force-dynamic`**; localized loading/error/Suspense; **Node** for Prisma/pg/FS not Edge; **`revalidatePath`** / tags after actions; optional **`after()`**.

**Packages:** Existing deps only; **`Env.ts`**, Logtape, Sentry — no ad-hoc env/logging/auth libs. **`server-only`** / client boundary — no server DB/auth in Client Components.

**Errors:** Recoverable failures → boundaries + fallbacks. Logtape / Sentry; else safe server logs, no secrets.

**Naming:** Clear names; renames in scope only. Simple code; comments where needed; magic numbers → constants.
